  "prefLabel": "Lab 802.07 \"Outside sales people\" as used in RSA 279:21, I means employees who make sales or obtain orders or contracts for services, are customarily and regularly engaged",
  "priorExpiration": "2007-11-14",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 802.07 \"Outside sales people\" as used in RSA 279:21, I means employees who make sales or obtain orders or contracts for services, are customarily and regularly engaged away from his or her place of business, and whose time is not scheduled by the employer.\n\nSource. #7007, eff 5-26-99; ss by #8879, INTERIM, eff 5-18-07, EXPIRES: 11-14-07; ss by #9024, eff 11-9-07; ss by #11070, eff 4-11-16 (from Lab 802.08)",
